ng your information safe and secure while you use our website, www.smartwatchsolutions.com.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-hero-intro", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swlead", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "38de110", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1240, "sizes": []}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 48, "column": "48", "row": "48", "isLinked": true}, "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "24", "bottom": "64", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}, "background_background": "classic", "css_classes": "sw-band sw-reveal sw-legal", "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "16", "bottom": "64", "left": "16", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 32, "column": "32", "row": "32", "isLinked": true}, "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=swwhite"}}, "elements": [{"id": "a50b123", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 16, "column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true}, "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 860, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}}, "elements": [{"id": "39cd0bf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Who we are", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b6098fa", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Smartwatch Solutions Ltd is East Africa's leading provider of fleet and mobile asset management solutions.</p><p>Founded in 2011, we provide Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) for fleet management, workshop management, and IoT smart solutions that improve safety, security, and productivity.</p><p>Address: Plot 7, Mundeka Road, Bugolobi, Balenzi Building, 1st Floor, P.O. Box 2359, Kampala, Uganda</p><p>Email: customersupport@smartwatchsolutions.com</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d1d8630", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Your privacy", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "880dc69", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We respect your privacy and only collect the information we need to make our website work better for you.</p><p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing.</p><p>Here's what we do:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "baa1351", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cookies: what they are", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fbf67a0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Like most websites, we use cookies.</p><p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help the website remember your preferences and improve your browsing experience.</p><p>Some cookies are essential for the website to work, while others help us understand how visitors use our site.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4c9d2a6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "How we use cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4ee3e95", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>These cookies help us make our website more useful and relevant to you. We use cookies to:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0b23f5a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Managing or turning off cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "06e728e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>You can choose to accept or reject cookies through your browser settings.</p><p>If you turn them off, some parts of the site may not work properly, but you'll still be able to browse most of it.</p><p>You can learn how to manage cookies in your browser's Help section.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "67a8f55", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Third-party cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c3bbea3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We may use trusted third-party tools like Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our website and improve our services.</p><p>These tools collect anonymous usage data, not your personal details. You can learn more at the official Google Analytics privacy page.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1e6bb4d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Email communication", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9aa7b3f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>If you sign up to receive updates or newsletters, we'll only send you information related to our services.</p><p>You can unsubscribe anytime using the link in our emails.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3effdd9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Your rights", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d5ff39b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Just email us at customersupport@smartwatchsolutions.com and we'll be happy to help. You can contact us anytime to:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fc85c88", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Changes to this policy", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "47d6585", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We may update this Cookie &amp; Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated date.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5c11330", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Contact us", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9b1f5cf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>If you have any questions about this policy or how we handle your data, please contact:</p><p>Smartwatch Solutions Ltd, Plot 7, Mundeka Road, Bugolobi, Balenzi Building, 1st Floor, P.O. Box 2359, Kampala, Uganda</p><p>customersupport@smartwatchsolutions.com</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-body", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}]}]